{"resourceIdentifier":"4598","resourceName":"Enhancing Livelihoods of Farmers in Gujarat through Agroforestry Plantations by SHBVM","description":"The projected ARR VCS initiative aims to help farmers in Gujarat, India, by providing them with additional income via the sale of carbon credits created by agroforestry tree crops on their land.\r\nShri Hari Bhujal Vikash Mandal (SHBVM), the project's co-proponent, has supported farmers in providing quality planting material for agroforestry species. They also provide on-site help to farmers who have registered with them for plantation maintenance. The project is being implemented in six Gujarat districts: Chhota Udepur, Mahisagar, Vadodara, Bharuch, Aravalli, and Panchmahal. Roughly 15 million seedlings will be planted on an area of around 4,000 hectares.","location":{"latitude":24.028299,"longitude":73.041398},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-10-27","endExclusive":"2023-11-27","endInclusive":"2023-11-26"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4598"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Gujarat"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Multiple Proponents"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Verification approval requested"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"6465"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ARR"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AR-AMS0007"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1977 Hectares"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Carbon Check (India) Private Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":